commit 36d7ad930d5c96bd6dbc87924384ebaed42bc7e1
Author: J.C.Ködel <jckodel@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Sep 30 15:11:56 2026 -0300

    Leave "saving" out of the weekly hours answer's report type (hours-answer)
    
    - Declare WeeklyHoursAnswerReport; WeeklyHoursReport is it or "saving"
    - WeeklyHoursAnswer's report is WeeklyHoursAnswerReport
    - docs/01 shape 6 names the type and why an answer cannot carry "saving"
    
    See work/done/hours-answer.md

